{# A Jinja template for the REMS license text created from the Bigpicture Policy XML
   attributes. Rendered with one variable per attribute TAG in policy_attributes.yaml.

   An attribute configured to allow "multiple" values produces a list of values.
   Referring to a TAG that does not exist in policy_attributes.yaml, or leaving a
   mandatory attribute out, is an error reported when the server starts.

   An optional paragraph owns the blank line that follows it.
#}
Policy text: {{ policy_text }}

Type of dataset: {{ type_of_dataset }}

Defined research question required: {{ defined_research_question_required }}

{% if legal_basis_for_sharing_the_data %}
Legal basis for sharing the data: {{ legal_basis_for_sharing_the_data }}

{% endif %}
{% if informed_consent_form_defined_use_restrictions %}
Use restrictions defined in informed consent form: {{ informed_consent_form_defined_use_restrictions }}

{% endif %}
{% if custom_use_restrictions %}
Custom use restrictions: {{ custom_use_restrictions }}

{% endif %}
Allowed geographical distribution: {{ allowed_geographical_distribution }}

Duration of access: {{ duration_of_access }}

Type of access: {{ type_of_access }}

{% for value in allowed_use %}
Allowed use: {{ value }}

{% endfor %}
{% if required_bigpicture_acknowledgements %}
Required Bigpicture acknowledgements: {{ required_bigpicture_acknowledgements }}

{% endif %}
{% for value in required_custom_acknowledgment %}
Required custom acknowledgement: {{ value }}

{% endfor %}
{% for value in required_citation %}
Required citation: {{ value }}

{% endfor %}
{% if coauthorship == "True" %}
If the dataset is central to the study’s conclusion or the Data Contributor provides substantial contributions in interpretation or data analysis, the Data Contributor should be offered the option to co-author any dissemination.

{% endif %}
Terms of use version: {{ terms_of_use_version }}
